  "title": "Original ESC teaching example - shunt sensing and filter",
  "source": ".title Original ESC teaching example - shunt sensing and filter\n* Supplied ideal current pulses; ideal gain stage, no ADC quantization/noise.\nIphase 0 shunt PULSE(0 20 500u 10u 10u 1m 3m)\nRshunt shunt 0 1m\nEamp amplified 0 shunt 0 50\nRfilter amplified adc 1k\nCfilter adc 0 1n\n.tran 2u 6m uic\n.end\n",
